# DEW nonlocal-metric MOND (arXiv:2512.10513) vs Cassini 2026 quadrupole -- Door II decision calc
####################################################################################################
  Cassini 2026: Q2 = (1.6 +/- 1.8)e-27 s^-2; 2-sigma ceiling 5.2e-27
  g_ext = 2.15e-10 m/s^2 (pre-registered), robustness [2e-10, 2.15e-10, 2.32e-10, 2.48e-10]
  footings: a0(DEW own) = 1.200e-10; a0(framework) = 9.3623e-11

====================================================================================================
PART 1  the DEW static-limit AQUAL mu (derived; two routes agree)
====================================================================================================
  mu(g) = 1 - exp(-y)(1 - y/2),  y = 2g/(3 a0)   [from f(Z)=Z/2 exp(-sqrt(Z)/3), mu = 1-2f'(Z)]
