   1.792    0.8781     0.6418       0.8732
   2.297    0.9493     0.6967       0.9169
   3.000    1.0000     0.7500       0.9487
   5.000    1.0238     0.8333       0.9806
  10.000    1.0030     0.9091       0.9950
  NOTE mu_DEW > 1 for g > 3a0 (anti-MOND overshoot, max 1.0249 at 4.5a0): sign-mixed EFE source.

